{"unit_id":"Erbsen16__dsh-client-ui-dracula#feature-3","repo":"Erbsen16/dsh-client-ui-dracula","commit":"dde48b1d8038d35520acb4d1e5e5724985bb11cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-dracula 的功能「阅读列宽」：将聊天正文列宽设为可调整的 CSS 变量，默认值为 1080px，并让输入区宽度跟随。适合希望同屏查看更长内容的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:47-60","lib/client.js:172-176"]}
